    "body": "Changed preview loading so it no longer opens an empty modal. The eye becomes a throbber while the real asset and geometry are prepared, and the viewer appears only when the model is ready. If you select another item, change tabs, or trigger a rerender first, the finished task stays silent and cached for the next click. Removed the Cached / Extracted now badge. The real hidden render test passed for the pistol, Canned Peaches, Aged Pirate Rum, and Jerky.",
